<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>adhan-mute</title>
		<meta name="description" content="A small cross-platform CLI that mutes system audio at each prayer time, based on your location." />
	</head>
	<body>
		<header>
			<div class="wrap">
				<div class="brand">adhan-mute</div>
				<a class="gh-link" href="https://github.com/wailbentafat/adhan-mute">GitHub</a>
			</div>
		</header>

		<main>
			<section class="hero">
				<div class="hero-glow"></div>
				<div class="wrap hero-inner">
					<div class="hero-copy">
						<span class="kicker">Command-line tool · macOS · Windows · Linux</span>
						<h1>Let the adhan through.</h1>
						<p class="sub">
							adhan-mute finds your local prayer times and quiets Spotify, YouTube,
							or anything else playing — for a few minutes at each prayer — then
							hands your volume back. No accounts, no cloud, nothing running but
							one small process on your machine.
						</p>
						<div class="cta-row">
							<a class="cta" href="https://github.com/wailbentafat/adhan-mute/releases/latest">Download latest release</a>
							<a class="cta ghost" href="#install">Install with uv instead</a>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="terminal">
						<div class="terminal-bar">
							<span class="dot red"></span>
							<span class="dot yellow"></span>
							<span class="dot green"></span>
						</div>
						<pre class="terminal-body"><code><span class="p">$</span> adhan-mute
Detecting location...
Location: Algiers (36.7538, 3.0588)
Fetching today's prayer times...
Today's times: Fajr 05:15 · Dhuhr 12:44 · Asr 16:17 · Maghrib 18:59 · Isha 20:12
Next: Maghrib at 18:59 (in 42.0 min)
<span class="hl">Maghrib — muting for 5 min.</span>
Unmuted (restored volume to 35).</code></pre>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="wrap install" id="install">
				<h2>Install</h2>
				<p class="note top">Prebuilt binaries need nothing installed — grab yours from the <a href="https://github.com/wailbentafat/adhan-mute/releases/latest">latest release</a> and run it.</p>
				<h3>From source, with uv</h3>
				<pre><code>git clone https://github.com/wailbentafat/adhan-mute
cd adhan-mute
uv sync
uv run main.py</code></pre>
				<p class="note">Requires <a href="https://docs.astral.sh/uv/">uv</a>. On Linux, also requires <code>alsa-utils</code> (usually preinstalled).</p>
			</section>

			<section class="wrap features">
				<h2>How it works</h2>
				<ol>
					<li>Detects your approximate location via IP geolocation (no account, no permissions).</li>
					<li>Fetches today's five prayer times for that location from the Aladhan API.</li>
					<li>Waits until the next prayer time.</li>
					<li>Mutes system volume, waits a configurable number of minutes, then restores your previous volume.</li>
					<li>Repeats daily.</li>
				</ol>
			</section>

			<section class="wrap options">
				<h2>Options</h2>
				<pre><code>uv run main.py --mute-minutes 5 --poll-seconds 60</code></pre>
				<table>
					<tbody>
						<tr>
							<td><code>--mute-minutes</code></td>
							<td>How long to keep audio muted at each prayer time. Default: 5.</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td><code>--poll-seconds</code></td>
							<td>How often to check the clock while waiting. Default: 60.</td>
						</tr>
					</tbody>
				</table>
			</section>
		</main>

		<footer class="wrap">
			<p>MIT-licensed. Source and issues on <a href="https://github.com/wailbentafat/adhan-mute">GitHub</a>.</p>
		</footer>

		<style>
			:root {
				--bg: #ffffff;
				--fg: #16181d;
				--muted: #5b6270;
				--border: #e4e6ea;
				--accent: #1f6feb;
				--code-bg: #f6f8fa;
				--dark: #0d1117;
			}

			* { box-sizing: border-box; }

			html, body {
				margin: 0;
				padding: 0;
				background: var(--bg);
				color: var(--fg);
				font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
				line-height: 1.6;
			}

			.wrap {
				max-width: 1040px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 0 1.5rem;
			}

			header {
				border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
			}
			header .wrap {
				display: flex;
				justify-content: space-between;
				align-items: center;
				padding-top: 1.1rem;
				padding-bottom: 1.1rem;
				max-width: 1040px;
			}
			.brand {
				font-weight: 700;
				font-size: 1rem;
			}
			.gh-link {
				color: var(--muted);
				text-decoration: none;
				font-size: 0.9rem;
				border: 1px solid var(--border);
				padding: 0.35rem 0.8rem;
				border-radius: 6px;
			}
			.gh-link:hover {
				border-color: var(--accent);
				color: var(--accent);
			}

			/* Hero */
			.hero {
				position: relative;
				background: var(--dark);
				color: #e8eaf0;
				overflow: hidden;
			}
			.hero-glow {
				position: absolute;
				inset: 0;
				background:
					radial-gradient(600px 400px at 15% 0%, rgba(31,111,235,0.35), transparent 60%),
					radial-gradient(500px 380px at 90% 20%, rgba(64,196,255,0.18), transparent 55%);
				pointer-events: none;
			}
			.hero-inner {
				position: relative;
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
				gap: 3rem;
				align-items: center;
				padding: 5rem 1.5rem;
			}
			@media (max-width: 860px) {
				.hero-inner {
					grid-template-columns: 1fr;
					padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem;
				}
			}

			.kicker {
				display: inline-block;
				font-size: 0.78rem;
				font-weight: 600;
				letter-spacing: 0.03em;
				color: #9fb4d8;
				border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
				background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
				padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
				border-radius: 999px;
				margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
			}

			h1 {
				font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 2.9rem);
				margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
				font-weight: 800;
				letter-spacing: -0.02em;
				line-height: 1.1;
				color: #fff;
			}
			.sub {
				color: #b8c0d4;
				font-size: 1.05rem;
				max-width: 480px;
				margin: 0 0 1.8rem;
			}

			.cta-row {
				display: flex;
				gap: 0.7rem;
				flex-wrap: wrap;
			}
			.cta {
				display: inline-block;
				padding: 0.65rem 1.3rem;
				border-radius: 6px;
				font-weight: 600;
				text-decoration: none;
				font-size: 0.92rem;
				background: var(--accent);
				color: #fff;
			}
			.cta:hover {
				background: #3f83f0;
			}
			.cta.ghost {
				background: transparent;
				border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
				color: #e8eaf0;
			}
			.cta.ghost:hover {
				border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
			}

			.terminal {
				border-radius: 10px;
				overflow: hidden;
				background: #161b22;
				border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
				box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
			}
			.terminal-bar {
				display: flex;
				gap: 0.4rem;
				padding: 0.7rem 0.85rem;
				background: #21262d;
			}
			.dot {
				width: 10px;
				height: 10px;
				border-radius: 50%;
			}
			.dot.red { background: #ff5f56; }
			.dot.yellow { background: #ffbd2e; }
			.dot.green { background: #27c93f; }
			.terminal-body {
				margin: 0;
				padding: 1.2rem 1.3rem 1.4rem;
				font-size: 0.8rem;
				line-height: 1.65;
				color: #c9d1d9;
				background: transparent;
				border: none;
				white-space: pre-wrap;
				word-break: break-word;
			}
			.terminal-body .p {
				color: #58a6ff;
			}
			.terminal-body .hl {
				color: #7ee787;
			}

			/* Content sections */
			section:not(.hero) {
				max-width: 720px;
				margin: 0 auto;
			}
			.wrap.install,
			.wrap.features,
			.wrap.options {
				padding: 2.2rem 1.5rem;
				border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
			}
			h2 {
				font-size: 1.15rem;
				margin: 0 0 1rem;
				font-weight: 700;
			}
			h3 {
				font-size: 0.92rem;
				margin: 1.6rem 0 0.7rem;
				font-weight: 700;
				color: var(--muted);
				text-transform: uppercase;
				letter-spacing: 0.03em;
			}

			pre {
				background: var(--code-bg);
				border: 1px solid var(--border);
				border-radius: 8px;
				padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
				overflow-x: auto;
				font-size: 0.88rem;
				line-height: 1.6;
			}
			code {
				font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
			}
			.note {
				color: var(--muted);
				font-size: 0.88rem;
				margin-top: 0.8rem;
			}
			.note.top {
				margin-top: 0;
				margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
			}

			ol {
				color: var(--fg);
				padding-left: 1.3rem;
				margin: 0;
			}
			ol li {
				margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
			}

			table {
				border-collapse: collapse;
				width: 100%;
				margin-top: 1rem;
				font-size: 0.9rem;
			}
			td {
				padding: 0.5rem 0.8rem 0.5rem 0;
				vertical-align: top;
				border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
			}
			td:first-child {
				white-space: nowrap;
				font-weight: 600;
			}

			a {
				color: var(--accent);
			}

			footer {
				max-width: 720px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 2rem 1.5rem 3rem;
				color: var(--muted);
				font-size: 0.88rem;
				border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
			}
		</style>
	</body>
</html>
